Nivel de vechime: Nivel mediu de experiență
Tip de angajare: Full-time
Sectoare de activitate: Servicii de marketing
We are a leading advertising agency in US and Europe. If you want to join a team of innovators, who LOVE what they do, be part of a fast growing company and know that you can change the lives of millions of people for the better, then this might be the job for you!
 You will learn a lot about cutting edge advertising, social media trends, newest marketing strategies, top performing banners, out of the box copywriting, split testing, marketing research, targeting, email marketing, etc.
 We're looking for a skilled Web Developer with a strong foundation in modern web technologies and a conversion-driven mindset to build and maintain high-performing sales landing pages and marketing funnels. You'll be responsible for creating user-friendly, responsive, and SEO-optimized platforms that drive measurable commercial results — while also leveraging AI-powered tools to accelerate development workflows and drive continuous performance improvement through data-driven experimentation. 
 Requirements: 
Must have an EXCELLENT command of the English language;
2+ years proven experience in web development;
Proficiency in HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and at least one back-end language or framework;
Experience with responsive design and mobile optimization;
Knowledge of web hosting, domains, and deployment;
Understanding of SEO principles and performance optimization;
Experience building sales landing pages, marketing funnels, and conversion-focused web experiences;
Familiarity with funnel-building platforms, CRM integrations, and marketing automation tools;
Familiarity with APIs, modern web frameworks, and development tools;
Experience with version control (Git), and understanding of web accessibility standards;
Experience using AI-assisted development tools to improve development speed and quality;
Familiarity with Google Analytics, heatmaps, user behaviour tracking, A/B testing and conversion rate optimization principles;
 As a WEB Developer , you will:
Develop and optimize responsive landing pages, marketing funnels and conversion-optimized web experiences;
Integrate and configure APIs, CRM systems, payment gateways, marketing automation tools, and tracking pixels;
Implement SEO, performance and web development best practices to ensure fast, reliable and user-friendly experiences;
Perform ongoing maintenance, updates, and troubleshooting;
Collaborate with marketing and sales teams to translate campaign strategies into high-converting web experiences;
Implement and maintain version control workflows (Git);
Document development processes, configurations, and updates for future reference;
Leverage AI-powered tools and technologies to streamline development processes, automate repetitive tasks, and enhance code quality;
Support conversion optimization initiatives by implementing A/B tests and using analytics and user behaviour insights to identify improvement opportunities;
Use AI-assisted development tools and identify opportunities to automate, template or componentize repetitive development work, improving development speed and code quality.
Collaborate with the Websites Manager to evaluate and prototype new website technologies, frameworks and platforms, identifying opportunities to improve development speed, scalability, maintainability and conversion performance.
 What we offer: 
Competitive fixed salary;
Private Medical Insurance;
Career growth opportunities within an international developing team;
Attractive work environment;
Good coffee and other perks;
 We are a leading direct response company that has sold countless products worldwide in the past 10 years, and we plan on becoming the No 1 direct response company in the World. We’ve already achieved this in the Survival and Natural Remedies niche in the highly competitive US market, so we know we can do it, it’s just a matter of time and getting the right people. We hope you will be one of them.
